  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:43:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:43:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Um, I am calling about the, the drain in the street. The catch basin. It is full of sand, all full, from the winter, the road treatment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:43:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's clogged with sand. Is water sitting in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:43:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Since Monday the water stays. No rain, nothing, it is dry weather, and still the street holds the water. Again this happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:43:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. Do you have a street address or a cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:43:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I, um, I prefer not to say now. A neighbor tells me it happens every big rain. Nobody cleans it. So, do the crews, they work on weekends?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:44:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes for emergencies, but a clogged basin usually gets scheduled on a weekday. I'll put in the request for a cleaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:44:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please, your name again? I want to write it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:44:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Denise. D-E-N-I-S-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:44:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Denise. Thank you. I wait and see."
    }
  ],
